  <title id="title">Eight Specialization Classes — Measured Gains</title>
  <desc id="desc">Grouped bar chart comparing instruction, VALU, and SALU reduction ratios across eight specialization classes, with annotations for scalar instruction deletion, the S2 register-pressure tradeoff, and the intentionally retained S7 negative result.</desc>

